            "verseId": "EXO.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.43.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 43:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ubāze igicaniro mu giti c’umushita, uburebure bgaco bube amatambge atanu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ubgaguke bube atanu nyene; ico gicaniro kize kingane impande zose. Kand’ uburebure bgaco bg’igihagararo buze bube amatambge atatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nkokora zaco ukw ari zine uz’ ugihe amahembe, ayo mahembe yaco az’ abāzirwe kuri co, abe kimwe na co; uheze ucomekekw imiringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ugicurire inzavya zo kuyoreramw’ umunyota waco, n’ibintu vyo kuwuyoza, bo n’imibehe yaco, n’ivyo kwōkōza inyama, n’ivyo kurahuza: ivyo bintu vyaco vyose ubicure mu miringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uz’ ugicurire ikintu c’insobane kimeze bga rusenga, ugicuze mu miringa; kand’ ico kintu kimeze nk’urusenga, uz’ ugitērekw ibigombo bine ku nkokora zaco ukw ari zine, ubicuze mu miringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugishire musi y’ igikugīrwa gikīkūje ico gicaniro, kugira ngo gihēre hasi, kigarukire ahacagatije ico gicaniro nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ubāzire ico gicaniro iminiho, iyo miniho uyibāze mu giti c’umushita, uyomekekw imiringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo miniho yaco ize yinjizwe mur’ ivyo bigombo, ibe mu mbavu zaco zompi mu kukirerura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uz’ ukibāze mu mbaho, ukigire igisamāre: nk’uk’ uvyerekewe kur’ uyu musozi, az’ abe ari ko bakibāza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ukore urugo rw’ iryo hema: ku ruhande ruhera i bumanuko, urwo rugo ruze rube urw’ impuzu zibamvye, zijishwe mu nyuzi zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza, uburebure bgazo bg’amakika yo kur’ urwo ruhande buze bube amatambge ijana y’ ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibirimbi zimanitsweko bize bibe mirongwibiri, n’ibitereko vyavyo vyo kubinegamwo bibe mirongwibiri nyene, bicuzwe mu miringa: imisumari yo kuri vyo iz’ icurwe mw ifeza, bo n’imitambikwa yo kuri vyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No ku ruhande ruhera i burārūko n’uko, haze habe impuzu zibamvye, uburebure bgazo bg’amakika buze bube amatambge ijana nyene, n’ibirimbi vyazo bize bibe mirongwibiri, n’ibitereko vyavyo bibe mirongwibiri nyene bicuzwe mu miringa; imisumari yo kuri vyo iz’ icurwe mw ifeza, bo n’imitambikwa yo kuri vyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ubgaguke bg’ urwo rugo, ahahera i burengerazuba, haze habe impuzu zibamvye z’amatambge mirongwitanu, ibirimbi vyazo bize bibe cumi, n’ibitereko vyavyo bibe cumi nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ubgaguke bg’urwo rugo, ahahera i burasirazuba, buze bube amatambge mirongwitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ruhande rumwe ruhera kw irembo haze habe impuzu zibamvye z’amatambge cumi n’atanu; ibirimbi vyazo bize bibe bitatu, n’ibitereko vyavyo bibe bitatu nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku rundi ruhande haze habe impuzu zibamvye z’amatambge cumi n’atanu; ibirimbi vyazo bize bibe bitatu, n’ibitereko vyavyo bibe bitatu nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ irembo ry’ urwo rugo rize rigire igihuzu co kuhakinga c’amatambge mirongwibiri, kijishwe mu nyuzi z’amasufe no mu z’amashigisha no mu zisa n’agahama, no mu zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza, kijererenzwekw amabara n’abahinga; bo n’ ibirimbi bine bitambagije, n’ibitereko vyavyo bine nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibirimbi vyose vy’urwo rugo vy’ impande zose bize bifatanywe n’ imitambikwa icuzwe mw ifeza, n’imisumari yo kuri vyo ibe ifeza nyene, n’ibitereko vyavyo vyo kubinegamwo bicurwe mu miringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uburebure bg’ amakika y’urwo rugo impande zompi buze bube amatambge ijana, n’ ubgaguke bgarwo bg’amakika buze bube amatambge mirongwitanu impande zompi, uburebure bgarwo bg’igihagararo buze bube amatambge atanu, ruze rube urw’ impuzu zijishwe mu nyuzi zera derere nziza zihinzwe neza, kand’ ibitereko vy’ibirimbi vyarwo bize bicurwe mu miringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibikoreshwa vyose vy’iryo hema vy’ ibikorwa vyaryo vyose, bo n’imambo zaryo zose, n’imambo zose z’urugo, bize bicurwe mu miringa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
